WEBVTT

00:03:29.836 --> 00:03:31.396
Inside Newcastle,

00:03:31.436 --> 00:03:33.636
the excitement was bubbling too.

00:03:33.676 --> 00:03:37.316
The management team was convinced
this is the start of a new era

00:03:37.356 --> 00:03:39.196
in the football club's history.

00:03:39.876 --> 00:03:43.156
So they decided to reward the head coach
and his whole coaching staff

00:03:43.196 --> 00:03:46.996
a historic-long, unbreakable
eight-year contract.

00:03:47.436 --> 00:03:51.556
And they really tried to do everything
they could to keep the squad together

00:03:51.596 --> 00:03:52.996
for the following season,

00:03:52.996 --> 00:03:55.316
because that's how
successful organizations

00:03:55.356 --> 00:03:56.756
are supposed to think, right?

00:03:56.796 --> 00:03:59.516
The following season this happened.

00:03:59.956 --> 00:04:01.676
Newcastle almost relegated.